* Wed Sep 02 2026 fravaccaro - 0.2.9-3
- Normalise gradient coordinate systems so cairo-based renderers no longer
  clip gradient-filled shapes, and re-export the affected icons.
- Make %post idempotent: skip directories already relocated to ~/.themepack
  and repair stale symlinks, instead of failing on every upgrade.
- Undo that relocation in %preun so uninstalling no longer floods the terminal
  with "remove failed" warnings and leaves nothing behind.
- CI verifies the committed PNGs against their SVG sources instead of silently
  re-exporting them at build time.
- Declare [X-Sailjail] in the desktop file, matching the other theme packs.

